  "name": "Service Request Advisor DSCUST",
  "description": "The 360 Insights Agent Team brings together a group of service experts and AI-powered agents dedicated to delivering end-to-end service excellence. This team collaboratively manages, configures, and optimizes the 360 Insights Agent ensuring seamless integration of Service Requests, Assets, Subscriptions, Warranties, KPIs, and role-based insights. As a unified command center, the team supports daily operations, rapid issue resolution, and ongoing process improvement, empowering both front-line agents and managers with the tools and intelligence needed for outstanding customer experiences.",
